    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d286">

                <pb facs="0477" n="163" sameAs="frus:frus1914Supp/pg163"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111/3</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé d’Affaires in
                        China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-07T13:00:00-05:00">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">August 7, 1914, 1 p.m.</hi>
                    </date>
                </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>Your telegram of August 3, 5 p.m. The Department authorizes Legation to
                    participate in proposed arrangement to neutralize all foreign settlements in
                    China not including leased areas.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
